message: "If you use this work, please cite the working paper."
type: report
title: "The Capability–Reliability Gap in Artificial Intelligence: An Evidence-Graded Review, Maturity Framework, and Research Agenda, 2020–2026"
repository-code: "https://github.com/redxking/capability-reliability-gap-ai"
authors:
  - family-names: Pseftis
    given-names: Angelis
abstract: >-
  This evidence-graded integrative review examines the asymmetry between
  demonstrated artificial-intelligence capability and public evidence for
  dependable operation. It proposes separate capability and assurance maturity
  axes, benchmark-validity criteria, an evidence-graded domain assessment, and
  a prioritized research agenda.
keywords:
  - artificial intelligence
  - AI evaluation
  - foundation models
  - operational reliability
  - AI assurance
  - technology forecasting
